# Claude Code. .claude/ itself is versioned on purpose — the agents, the hooks
# and settings.json are part of the project. Only the per-machine layer is not.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Subagent worktrees. The Agent tool cuts one per isolated agent and leaves it
# behind; each is an embedded git repository, so a `git add -A` commits a gitlink
# per worktree, every one of which clones as an empty directory. That happened
# once, on 2026-08-26.
.claude/worktrees/
